'<!-- Section properties of a quarter circle: area, centroid offsets, second moments of area and radii of gyration. -->
'<h1>Geometrical Properties of Quarter Circle</h1>
'<div style="max-width:120mm"><img style="height:120pt;" alt="quarter-circle.png" class="side" src="../../Images/mechanics/sections/quarter-circle.png"></div>
#UI 'Radius -'r = 1m
'Area
A = π*r^2/4
'Centroid
'<p><i>z</i><sub>c</sub> ='y_c = 4*r/(3*π)'</p>
'Perimeter
P = (π/2+2)*r
'Second moments of area
'<p><i>I</i><sub>z</sub> ='I_y = (π/16 - 4/(9*π))*r^4'</p>
I_yz = (1/8 - 4/(9*π))*r^4'</p>
'Principal area moments
I_1 = I_y + abs(I_yz)
I_2 = I_y - abs(I_yz)
'Angle of principal axis
α_1 = atan((I_y - I_1)/I_yz)
'Polar moment of area
I_x = 2*I_y
'Radii of gyration
'<p><i>r</i><sub>z</sub> ='r_y = sqr(I_y/A)'</p>
r_1 = sqr(I_1/A)
r_2 = sqr(I_2/A)
r_x = sqr(I_x/A)
